findings.message:
Several pins don't resolve to their exact record:
- every data-class row, the Provider card and the Subprocessors card pin get_ai_policy {} (the whole policy);
- the per-module tool cards on Integrations pin settings_overview {area:'integrations'};
- the 'Failed runs' ticket pins list_workflow_runs without status:'failed'.

Pass narrowing args, such as the class name or `status`, so each pin resolves to what it shows.
